      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gotanda",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After World War II, a black market sprang up north of Tokyu Station, and the area became known for its many love hotels.",
