      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gotanda",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2002 Tokyo declared Gotanda and Osaki a redevelopment zone, sparking a wave of high‑rise offices and condos in the 2000s.",
